+# Browser handoff and durable routine decisions Engineering32 - 2026-11-20
+
+Local candidate under BRAIN-ONSKIN-AUTONOMOUS-LOCAL-RELIABILITY-32. One bounded cancellable exclusive Web Lock request admits actual callbacks only; a sustained competing runtime requires explicit recovery. Original actual-routine apply/clear/retraction decisions now prepare encrypted purpose/owner/consent-epoch-bound evidence and verify readback before dispatch. Discoverable owner review separates read-only exact inspection, fresh-authority original-identity retry and ledger-verified acknowledgement. Unsupported/unreadable evidence remains closed; cleanup/export/key inventory includes the new purpose. Frozen all38/all18 remain UNACCEPTED; release NO_GO, J01 positive admission closed. Browser/process and final-source validation receipts and retained failures are delivered separately; no native/backend/professional/source publication authority is implied.
+
+Forced-process probes exposed localStorage rollback of command preparation, ledger successors and withdrawal authority. Eight fixed browser ciphertext rows (including the original canonical routine source stores) now require strict IndexedDB completion, using unchanged encryption and key custody. A completed withdrawal audits retained raw purpose bytes again after restart and reopens guarded cleanup while processing remains closed. Legacy control/ledger inspection never provisions a database; ambiguous recovery prototypes and missing-primary legacy shadows refuse. Explicit acknowledgement retains bounded original evidence; no automatic eviction or startup replay.
+
