+## Engineering32 bounded browser handoff and original routine decisions (local, unaccepted)
+
+Browser startup/reload/direct entry → one exclusive Web Lock request, waiting at most three seconds → actual lock callback → private startup. A closing document may hand off during that bounded wait. A live holder beyond the bound leaves private access paused; close the holder, then explicitly Retry private app access. Pending document departure aborts only its request. Blur, route changes and unmount never release held authority. Unsupported/rejected coordination stays closed; query results never admit access.
+
+Routine records → review exact apply / clear / original recorded-use retraction → explicit confirm → encrypted owner/purpose/consent-epoch-bound original command preparation and authenticated readback → dispatch using the original live authority → ledger readback → separate exact acknowledgement. An interrupted preparation cannot dispatch; a lost result retains the original identity, time, predecessor, apply ordered source facts or exact original use/stream evidence. No command replays on startup.
+
+Routine records → Review saved routine decisions → confirmed collection / unavailable or unsupported refusal → Review saved decision → original facts and identity → Inspect original routine decision (read-only) → recorded_current / recorded_historical / conflict / not_found / unreadable. Not-found never proves failure. Explicit Retry this original routine decision reacquires current access and, for apply, a new approved in-memory source proof matching the original facts. Changed source/predecessor/target refuses. Acknowledge exact saved routine outcome is separate and rechecks the exact ledger under reservation before marking acknowledgement while retaining the original evidence for inspection. Close/Escape/navigation leaves unresolved evidence intact; canceled/stale callbacks cannot operate on a successor. Applying records no use; retraction preserves the original event. Withdrawal/full clearing remove the registered purpose key; export contains strict evidence, never live capabilities. Capacity refuses new preparation without purging unresolved work. All38/all18 remain UNACCEPTED; native/backend/scientific qualification remains absent.
+
+Forced-browser-process testing found that localStorage readback could lose the newest prepared command, ledger successor or withdrawal authority receipt. Eight inventoried browser rows therefore retain only existing privateKV-encrypted ciphertext in strict IndexedDB transactions: routine recovery, completion ledger, original health lifecycle and original consent, and the four original canonical routine source stores (Shelf, profile, choices and order). Canonical source loss was independently reproduced after a forced restart; these stores remain authoritative only through their unchanged decoders and newly captured live source proofs. Persisted command facts are never restored into those stores. Preparation requires completed encrypted readback before dispatch. Reads preserve legacy lifecycle/consent/ledger bytes without creating or migrating a database. Unsupported durability or older localStorage recovery prototype evidence refuses rather than overwrites. After restart, an existing completed withdrawal rechecks raw health-purpose absence under its original owner fence; retained or unreadable bytes reopen cleanup while processing stays closed. The original consent/lifecycle receipts remain outside purpose erasure under their existing policy. Acknowledgement marks and retains the original command evidence for inspect-only review. The collection is bounded to 100 records and 512,000 plaintext UTF-8 bytes; acknowledged and unresolved records remain until explicit purpose/full cleanup, and capacity stops new preparation without automatic eviction. Native AsyncStorage/key custody is unchanged and its physical crash qualification remains absent.
+
 ## Engineering28 practice template library and navigation retirement (local, unaccepted)
 
 Critical professional web flow at 375×667 and 430×932: Practice templates → Load practice templates → real default503 refusal / admitted practice-only template history → New practice template → generic title and explicit ordered product roles → Review template revision → Return to draft / Save exact template revision → immutable readback → expand any dated prior revision → Revise → cancel or explicitly save a separate revision → Retire → Keep active / Confirm exact retirement → reload retained history. Unknown save retries the identical command; changed authority/history requires fresh review. Missing/corrupt history refuses instead of provisioning. Clear/background/session replacement invalidates pending work and captured controls. Keyboard focus moves to the new heading; title input keeps focus. No owner source or private client plan is imported, no owner record is changed, and no licence or provider admission is created. Exact role-to-bottle mapping, unshelved proposals, plan issuance from a template and original-owner application remain unavailable.
